00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,085
Politico Europe reports that new polling finds older and wealthier people are more positive about artificial intelligence than younger adults.

2
00:00:10,035 --> 00:00:16,814
The result suggests that AI is not only a technology debate, but also a social one.

3
00:00:16,814 --> 00:00:26,329
Younger people may worry more about jobs, fairness and control, while others focus on productivity gains and new services.

